You are a senior full-stack software architect, Python engineer, data migration specialist, database designer, and UI/UX engineer.

I want you to DESIGN AND BUILD a production-style web application called:

"GenMove Migration Accelerator"

The application is an enterprise SAP data migration accelerator that combines:

1. Migration Request Management
2. Legacy File Upload
3. SAP Preload Template Upload
4. Source Data Profiling
5. AI-Assisted Source-to-Target Mapping
6. Transformation Rule Management
7. SAP/Data Quality Validation
8. Value Mapping Management
9. Mapping Review and Approval
10. Migration Readiness Scoring
11. Excel Reporting
12. Audit Logging

IMPORTANT:
Do not create only a demo screen.

Build this as a modular, maintainable application with a real PostgreSQL database, backend services, validation engine, file-processing layer, and usable frontend.

